:db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422/field-3/15ac438add526b668cd4cf912df4b721a52d65b1047bd5c8d3821352de549abd" :answer/id #uuid "9a3d0e71-862b-5121-8e8a-f41f74a8c9f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t)=x(t)+{t}_{0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "520e2265-8908-5302-b8ef-e6bfd81fa6a9" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-335422/field-3/1b993e9f9ca34a7a5919a16cf7202edefa2c2f38c12c029ea82210f23656c0d9" :answer-field/choices ["q-335422/field-3/435455baf9999aafb706d9a4df64dfb8a2e73205a93eea99ba78031d4518a8ef" "q-335422/field-3/6f4e7053a26cd09be14eeba68292d016ad600bc07741cce082a970e1d98ddf62" "q-335422/field-3/1b993e9f9ca34a7a5919a16cf7202edefa2c2f38c12c029ea82210f23656c0d9" "q-335422/field-3/15ac438add526b668cd4cf912df4b721a52d65b1047bd5c8d3821352de549abd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422/field-4/c19eeb748c0840b522e06ff831279ffd81115e653238a195a6befae39a5135a6" :answer/id #uuid "11dc4ab2-17d0-5655-845e-018b6216b35c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "evaluating at $t={t}_{0}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422/field-4/3e398d603a43d67ea0c2e6aaf97b937ceca671994606ecb832c571efa5b91015" :answer/id #uuid "19619de0-288b-5646-8195-e82c4590fbc6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422/field-4/26d127a95d304dbdd7adffc27a42a2c2fd29dd6893f9f60cf304e38ecb659143" :answer/id #uuid "30aff85f-11e4-5a38-883d-7267c0f7d666" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{A(t+{t}_{0})}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422/field-4/0ba2d57a283410bc2e964e7528110750e41526c5ef29b851dde5d8dd369a44c0" :answer/id #uuid "f21d26a9-6a27-524a-bf1d-53a020a99a41" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "differentiating and using the sum rule" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "e3a7adb1-efef-5136-b5f2-670f465104af" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-335422/field-4/3e398d603a43d67ea0c2e6aaf97b937ceca671994606ecb832c571efa5b91015" :answer-field/choices ["q-335422/field-4/c19eeb748c0840b522e06ff831279ffd81115e653238a195a6befae39a5135a6" "q-335422/field-4/3e398d603a43d67ea0c2e6aaf97b937ceca671994606ecb832c571efa5b91015" "q-335422/field-4/26d127a95d304dbdd7adffc27a42a2c2fd29dd6893f9f60cf304e38ecb659143" "q-335422/field-4/0ba2d57a283410bc2e964e7528110750e41526c5ef29b851dde5d8dd369a44c0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335422" :question/id #uuid "d73d6273-7a31-5998-90dd-91a300f07c9c" :question/math-academy-id "q-335422" :question/problem "Consider the inhomogeneous system  ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix. A derivation of the formula for the solution $x(t)$ passing through $x({t}_{0})$ is presented below.\n\n$\\text{L1}:\\,$ Let $y(t)={e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L2}:\\,$ ${y}^{′}(t)=-A{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L3}:\\,$ ${y}^{′}(t)={e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}g(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L4}:\\,$ $y(t)-y({t}_{0})={\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\n$\\text{L5}:\\,$ $y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0})$ \n\n$\\text{L6}:\\,$ $y(t)=x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$  \n\n$\\text{L7}:\\,$ ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t)={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\n$\\text{L8}:\\,$ ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t)=x(t)$\n\n$\\text{L9}:\\,$ $x(t)={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\nSelect the correct options to justify each step of the reasoning.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L2}$ follows from $\\text{L1}$ by  \n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L6}$ follows from line\n{{field-2}}\nby substituting \n{{field-3}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L7}$ follows from line $\\text{L6}$ by  \n{{field-4}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's justify each of the selected steps.\n\n- We first consider lines $\\text{L1}$ and $\\text{L2}.$ Differentiating $y(t)={e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)$ and applying the product rule gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(t) & =({e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})})^{′}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =(-A){e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =-A{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}x(t)+{e}^{-A(t-{t}_{0})}{x}^{′}(t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L2}$ follows from $\\text{L1}$ by $\\text{differentiating and using the product rule}.$\n\n- Next, we consider lines $\\text{L4}$, $\\text{L5}$, and $\\text{L6}.$ From $\\text{L4}$ we have\n\n$$\ny(t)-y({t}_{0})={\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nUsing $y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0})$ from $\\text{L5}$, this becomes\n\n$$\ny(t)-x({t}_{0})={\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s,\n$$\n\nso\n\n$$\ny(t)=x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L6}$ follows from $\\text{L4}$ by substituting $y({t}_{0})=x({t}_{0}).$\n\n- Finally, we consider lines $\\text{L6}$ and $\\text{L7}.$ Multiplying both sides of\n\n$$\ny(t)=x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,ds\n$$\n\nfrom $\\text{L6}$ by ${e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}y(t) & ={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{-A(s-{t}_{0})}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & ={e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}x({t}_{0})+{\\int }_{{t}_{0}}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{L7}$ follows from $\\text{L6}$ by $\\text{multiplying both sides by }{e}^{A(t-{t}_{0})}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-335422/field-1" "q-335422/field-2" "q-335422/field-3" "q-335422/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4c4b78fa-76af-5261-87a0-d1960aa0fe04